WEBVTT

00:01.270 --> 00:07.500
Err, Speerio Rosa Burosa.

00:07.500 --> 00:10.080
Sumomo, this Recipe is...

00:10.080 --> 00:11.390
Yes.

00:11.390 --> 00:16.620
A Recipe that emits warmth which gives courage and confidence.

00:19.190 --> 00:21.340
Speerio Rosa Burosa

00:27.290 --> 00:29.850
Wah, amazing!

00:32.300 --> 00:34.030
That's great, Sumomo!

00:35.020 --> 00:37.000
Let's go, Yuki-chan.

00:54.150 --> 01:00.870
Shining stars away bless

00:54.700 --> 01:00.870
Shining stars away bless

01:01.200 --> 01:06.080
chiisakutonaeru mahou no kotobawa

01:01.200 --> 01:06.080
Silently chanting the magical words

01:06.960 --> 01:08.710
『onegai。。。』

01:06.960 --> 01:08.710
"please"

01:09.000 --> 01:14.340
hoshizora samayou kaze ni notta maigo notsubu

01:09.000 --> 01:14.340
The lost grain riding the wind on the sky

01:14.340 --> 01:15.380
『kizuite。。。』

01:14.340 --> 01:15.380
Please notice

01:15.380 --> 01:23.270
tsutawara nakute porori ochita kono omoi

01:15.380 --> 01:23.270
Untold words, teardrops of feelings that fell down

01:23.770 --> 01:30.360
kagayaki dasuyo GARASU bin nonaka

01:23.770 --> 01:30.360
Show your shine inside the glass bottle

01:30.730 --> 01:37.740
manten no hoshi deatta KISEKI kimi ga soba ni itekureru nara

01:30.730 --> 01:37.740
If you will stay beside me perfect star of encountered miracles...

01:37.910 --> 01:45.120
Whatever the mystery, I will be able to gather my courage.

01:38.320 --> 01:45.120
donna fushigi mouke tomeru yuuki umare te yuku yo

01:45.450 --> 01:52.710
nanatsuiro ni hikaru houseki sora kara mai oriru

01:45.450 --> 01:52.710
Seven colored glittering gems flying down from the sky

01:52.710 --> 01:56.420
Scoop up the important fragments

01:53.130 --> 01:56.420
daijina KAKERA sukui agerune

01:56.420 --> 02:01.930
kowasa nuyou sotto。。。

01:56.420 --> 02:01.930
And secretly hold onto them tight

02:14.000 --> 02:16.000
We're doing this quite fast...

02:16.000 --> 02:18.730
Should we wait until it actually drops down?

02:18.730 --> 02:20.100
It's alright.

02:20.100 --> 02:21.940
Just watch, Yuki-chan.

02:29.750 --> 02:31.520
Puruvu Radi

02:39.590 --> 02:41.490
Amazing, Sumomo!

02:41.490 --> 02:43.480
You've been getting really good at this.

02:43.480 --> 02:45.880
It's all thanks to you, Yuki-chan.

02:48.710 --> 02:50.500
One more remaining, right?

02:52.350 --> 02:53.780
What's the matter?

02:57.070 --> 02:59.990
After gathering all the star drops...

03:00.500 --> 03:04.660
You'll go back home, right, Yuki-chan?

03:04.680 --> 03:08.000
Huh? Ah... Yes...

03:09.800 --> 03:14.750
I'll be lonely when that time comes...

03:14.750 --> 03:16.100
Sumomo...

03:17.750 --> 03:20.760
Sorry for suddenly being sad.

03:20.920 --> 03:23.840
I'll do my best, so look forward to it.

03:27.300 --> 03:30.220
<i>Akihime would never have thought, not even in her dreams... </i>

03:31.360 --> 03:35.760
<i>that Yuki-chan's real identity... is Tsuwabuki Masaharu.</i>

03:38.030 --> 03:41.860
Sand Beige Colored Sadness

03:38.030 --> 03:41.860
Sand Beige Colored Sadness

03:42.420 --> 03:45.120
So now six star drops have been collected.

03:45.370 --> 03:49.560
Soon you'll no longer be Yuki-chan.

03:50.530 --> 03:54.170
How about staying as Yuki-chan, since he is really cute.

03:54.170 --> 03:55.540
Think about me for a second!

03:56.690 --> 03:58.870
So then, what kind of advice do you need?

04:00.030 --> 04:05.030
I want to tell her that Yuki-chan is actually me.

04:05.390 --> 04:08.060
You don't want to lie to your girlfriend?

04:08.060 --> 04:09.410
M-My girlfriend?!

04:09.410 --> 04:12.080
You don't have to feel embarrassed...

04:13.380 --> 04:17.900
that both you and Akihime are officially a couple in love.

04:19.790 --> 04:21.440
It's good to be young!

04:22.630 --> 04:27.180
However, it won't be long before all seven star drops are gathered.

04:27.180 --> 04:28.990
So wouldn't it be better telling her after that?

04:30.130 --> 04:34.540
I feel as if I'm deceiving Akihime.

04:34.540 --> 04:36.880
I want to tell her the truth as soon as possible!

04:37.020 --> 04:39.860
Well, I do understand how you feel.

04:40.350 --> 04:45.360
But, you must never do that, Tsuwabuki-kun.

04:45.360 --> 04:47.590
Something that can never be reversed will happen.

04:48.240 --> 04:50.850
Something that can never be reversed?

04:51.030 --> 04:56.790
If Yuki-chan's identity is known to Sumomo-chan...

05:00.830 --> 05:05.310
<i>I guess I'll have to wait until we gather all seven star drops. </i>

05:05.730 --> 05:07.420
U-Umm...

05:09.540 --> 05:10.800
Akihime.

05:13.500 --> 05:15.750
Good morning, Haru-kun.

05:19.750 --> 05:20.770
Sumomo?

05:20.980 --> 05:22.850
You just called him Haru-kun, right?

05:23.040 --> 05:24.140
She did, she did!

05:24.380 --> 05:26.360
So madly in love, aren't they?

05:26.360 --> 05:27.790
Haru, your reply?

05:28.790 --> 05:30.990
Don't tell me you're going to say "Akihime"?

05:31.310 --> 05:34.320
It's just natural to use her first name when you were just called by yours.

05:34.420 --> 05:37.540
Go Haru-kun! Be courageous and say it!

05:37.850 --> 05:39.100
Sumomo!

05:45.520 --> 05:46.910
Ah, too bad.

05:47.700 --> 05:49.520
Such good timing too!

05:49.740 --> 05:50.990
The ion exchange resin is...

05:55.100 --> 05:58.060
<i>It's good if I can do that... </i>

05:58.550 --> 06:00.370
<i>calling her Sumomo...</i>

06:08.470 --> 06:11.640
Miss, what is the matter? Miss?!

06:11.910 --> 06:13.160
Miss!

06:17.480 --> 06:19.980
Timu Forna Mei...

06:19.980 --> 06:22.970
Such a high level Recipe used by that girl.

06:23.590 --> 06:28.410
Without working so hard just because she is Karin-sama's daughter...

06:33.110 --> 06:35.210
Timu Forna Mei.

06:36.160 --> 06:37.620
I can do it too!

06:43.680 --> 06:49.260
Nako-chan, you can't go home together with me after club activities today, right?

06:49.260 --> 06:52.600
Today I have to go to the dojo, so...

06:52.600 --> 06:53.240
What is it?

06:54.160 --> 06:58.270
I was just thinking about visiting Nona-chan on the way home.

06:58.450 --> 07:01.610
Since she hasn't been coming to class for a few days now...

07:01.610 --> 07:03.650
and I'm worried about her.

07:03.650 --> 07:05.320
<i>Akihime...</i>

07:06.540 --> 07:12.650
<i>To Akihime, Yuuki is her rival in gathering the star drops, but...</i>

07:13.470 --> 07:15.750
<i>Because Akihime is like that...</i>

07:17.720 --> 07:20.630
<i>Right now, I honestly feel that I can call her by her first name.  </i>

07:22.110 --> 07:25.480
Umm, can I join in too, Su-

07:26.920 --> 07:29.470
Su? So what is after the Su, Haru?

07:29.470 --> 07:31.900
Come on, say it! Say it!

07:31.900 --> 07:33.050
Don't be shy now.

07:33.050 --> 07:36.160
Hey you guys, stop teasing them.

07:36.470 --> 07:37.910
We aren't teasing them.

07:37.910 --> 07:39.110
Yeah, that's right, we aren't.

07:39.110 --> 07:42.740
We're just giving them our moral support!

07:42.740 --> 07:45.720
Go, go! Haru-tan, do your best!

07:45.720 --> 07:49.110
And I just said no teasing them.

07:50.860 --> 07:52.790
Guess it's impossible in school.

08:03.230 --> 08:04.880
One more time!

08:10.930 --> 08:12.580
Timu Forna Mei!

08:20.190 --> 08:22.020
Wow!

08:22.690 --> 08:24.720
What a nice mansion!

08:25.610 --> 08:26.880
Y-Yeah.

08:27.120 --> 08:29.630
E-Err, the entrance bell is...

08:29.630 --> 08:31.070
Sumomo!

08:33.790 --> 08:35.140
Nako-chan!

08:39.240 --> 08:42.870
I got permission to get off early.

08:42.870 --> 08:44.150
Nako-chan.

08:45.960 --> 08:50.590
I wanted to visit Yuuki-san too. Is that alright?

08:50.750 --> 08:51.980
Yep!

08:54.700 --> 08:55.950
Y-Yes!

08:56.270 --> 08:58.890
H-Hello, this is Tsuwabuki.

08:58.890 --> 09:01.460
Tsuwabuki-kun? You came at the right time!

09:09.920 --> 09:10.900
Welcome!

09:11.060 --> 09:12.930
Umm, we're here...

09:12.930 --> 09:13.960
Tsuwabuki-kun!

09:15.890 --> 09:18.700
Tsuwabuki-kun, please help!

09:19.980 --> 09:24.420
Can I have some of your transformation potion?

09:24.720 --> 09:29.560
Since Miss doesn't want to listen to anything at the moment.

09:29.620 --> 09:32.120
Uhh, what do you mean?

09:32.640 --> 09:35.090
Ah! Those ears!

09:35.240 --> 09:41.510
Yes, I was trying to put the potions in batches when this accident happened...

09:41.630 --> 09:43.560
So it was you!

09:43.560 --> 09:44.080
Yes?

09:44.080 --> 09:48.090
I ended up taking the wrong juice when I bumped into you at school!

09:49.360 --> 09:52.850
Because of that, I change to a sheep doll at night!

09:53.960 --> 09:58.700
Err... Tsuwabuki-kun, you're not from Figurare?

09:58.700 --> 10:03.420
No! I changed to a sheep doll because of the potion that you dropped!

10:04.570 --> 10:07.950
Ehh?! I am so sorry!

10:07.950 --> 10:10.630
What have I done to Miss's classmate!?

10:13.670 --> 10:15.010
Final Secret Move

10:15.340 --> 10:15.380
Matsuda Family's Final Secret Move

10:16.260 --> 10:16.300
Kneeling Face Down on the Ground

10:16.320 --> 10:18.630
Please forgive me!

10:22.440 --> 10:23.490
It's okay.

10:24.440 --> 10:27.860
Umm, you are forgiving me?

10:28.530 --> 10:31.740
Well yeah, since it wasn't all that bad.

10:32.870 --> 10:35.280
Thank you very much!

10:40.110 --> 10:42.480
Well, I will call Miss.

10:42.660 --> 10:44.260
I am here.

10:44.600 --> 10:45.670
Miss.

10:46.360 --> 10:47.570
Nona-chan!

10:48.640 --> 10:50.770
Are you feeling better now?

10:50.770 --> 10:52.580
Everyone was worried about you.

10:52.990 --> 10:54.190
Here are some flowers.

10:54.630 --> 10:55.940
Miss!

10:59.480 --> 11:01.680
Thank you for the flowers!

11:02.480 --> 11:04.180
Nona-chan...

11:04.530 --> 11:07.780
I don't want to be called that name by you.

11:08.470 --> 11:10.940
Speerio Sharuruze Wein

11:12.910 --> 11:17.940
I am Saint Aspalas' Prima, Prima Aspalas!

11:17.940 --> 11:20.300
Let's do our last battle today!

11:21.990 --> 11:23.840
Come, Prima Plam!

11:25.500 --> 11:26.830
Yuuki...

11:33.880 --> 11:35.170
Nako-chan!

11:35.460 --> 11:38.220
I'll leave Haru-kun to you!

11:40.680 --> 11:42.510
Hey, Yaeno! Hey!

11:42.630 --> 11:45.340
Tsuwabuki, I'll explain later.

11:45.350 --> 11:48.790
That's not what I mean. I'm...

11:52.820 --> 11:54.760
Speerio Rosa Burosa

11:57.670 --> 11:59.850
So you even know the transformation Recipe now too.

12:00.360 --> 12:04.500
Well, you're becoming more and more of a worthy opponent.

12:04.960 --> 12:06.520
Arthur! The vial.

12:06.850 --> 12:09.050
Yes, Miss.

12:15.320 --> 12:17.020
The star drops...

12:18.390 --> 12:19.990
Miss, what are you doing...?

12:23.880 --> 12:27.140
Wah, the star drops are...

12:33.400 --> 12:36.020
Now, which of us can capture the star drops!?

12:37.690 --> 12:38.740
Time to fight!

12:57.490 --> 12:59.280
If the star drops are flying, then...

13:00.430 --> 13:02.140
Paradivu Mei!

13:08.290 --> 13:09.760
I won't let you!

13:10.670 --> 13:12.520
Aquavu Puruvida!

13:19.910 --> 13:21.720
Puruvi Radius!

13:25.340 --> 13:28.450
She used the water to lure the star drops?

13:29.030 --> 13:32.310
And capturing three of them at once!

13:32.470 --> 13:35.580
Aspalas-san is amazing, after all.

13:35.580 --> 13:37.810
Let me go, Yaeno!

13:38.010 --> 13:40.020
Let me go to Akihime.

13:40.020 --> 13:40.460
No!

13:41.290 --> 13:42.490
Yaeno...

13:44.540 --> 13:45.230
Akihime!

13:48.600 --> 13:49.590
Yaeno.

13:49.690 --> 13:52.590
Tsuwabuki, I cannot let you go.

13:53.440 --> 13:54.680
Even if it means I have to use force.

13:55.410 --> 13:56.700
Yaeno...

13:58.280 --> 14:01.820
If you work hard, you will gain power.

14:01.820 --> 14:04.580
I thought that's how it went.

14:04.580 --> 14:12.960
But you on the other hand receive new powers just by doing it without any practice.

14:12.960 --> 14:15.080
W-What do you mean?

14:15.300 --> 14:16.810
I will not approve of that!

14:17.230 --> 14:19.380
You're the only person I don't want to lose to!

14:19.380 --> 14:20.460
Never!

14:20.600 --> 14:25.410
I have to let Yuki-chan return to the Doll Land too.

14:25.970 --> 14:28.110
There's no way that I'll lose!

14:29.960 --> 14:32.170
Timu Forna Mei!

14:36.280 --> 14:37.780
This is...

14:38.240 --> 14:41.590
Right, a Recipe that can slow down time.

14:42.350 --> 14:44.970
I can do it too.

14:45.600 --> 14:47.960
Patis Aqua Omis!

14:50.820 --> 14:52.130
I've got it now!

14:54.990 --> 14:56.860
I have to do my best!

14:58.080 --> 15:00.200
For Yuki-chan's sake!

15:00.340 --> 15:03.740
Tamo Rei!

15:06.490 --> 15:07.670
I'm back to normal!

15:11.910 --> 15:14.350
You must be kidding! From that far away?!

15:17.530 --> 15:18.730
I won't let you do that!

15:19.130 --> 15:20.360
Again!

15:20.360 --> 15:22.520
Timu Forna Mei!

15:25.670 --> 15:26.710
It can't be!

15:27.580 --> 15:28.410
Unbelievable!

15:30.080 --> 15:31.140
Timu Forna...

15:32.720 --> 15:33.330
This is...

15:33.880 --> 15:35.330
Don't tell me I screwed up?

15:35.910 --> 15:37.810
Miss, watch out!

15:37.810 --> 15:40.320
It'll be dangerous if you keep on casting that spell!

15:40.790 --> 15:42.660
That's right, Aspalas-san.

15:42.840 --> 15:44.840
That Recipe is not normal!

15:45.990 --> 15:48.460
I can do this.

15:49.380 --> 15:51.050
Timu Forna Mei!

15:53.520 --> 15:54.510
Miss!

16:02.080 --> 16:04.890
Aspalas-... No! Nona-chan!

16:05.310 --> 16:06.540
Nona-chan!

16:09.690 --> 16:10.950
Akihime!

16:11.240 --> 16:12.530
You can't.

16:12.620 --> 16:13.900
What are you doing?!

16:13.900 --> 16:18.070
I will not stand by and do nothing while Akihime is in trouble!

16:18.070 --> 16:21.870
Tsuwabuki, if anything happens to you, Sumomo will be sad.

16:22.080 --> 16:24.680
I want to be Sumomo's strength too!

16:25.680 --> 16:29.110
But... I cannot, so...

16:29.390 --> 16:31.720
I can. There's something that I can do!

16:31.860 --> 16:33.130
Eh?

16:33.630 --> 16:37.650
Because I have always been with Akihime gathering the star drops.

16:38.220 --> 16:42.270
Tsuwabuki, how do you know about the star drops...?

16:44.600 --> 16:45.770
Tsuwabuki!

16:48.180 --> 16:49.630
Nona-chan!

16:49.970 --> 16:51.280
Where are you?

16:51.410 --> 16:53.810
Please say something, Nona-chan!

16:55.780 --> 16:57.550
T-This is....

17:01.610 --> 17:03.450
Please help!

17:03.450 --> 17:05.690
The two of them are inside!

17:06.420 --> 17:07.340
Inside this?

17:11.050 --> 17:12.270
<i>Sumomo...</i>

17:12.950 --> 17:14.670
Sumomo!

17:21.790 --> 17:24.840
Sumomo! Sumomo!

17:26.980 --> 17:29.360
You must never do that, Tsuwabuki-kun.

17:30.030 --> 17:33.750
If your real identity is known to Sumomo-chan,

17:33.930 --> 17:37.770
you will cease to move, think or speak.

17:37.770 --> 17:40.390
You will become just a normal doll.

17:40.390 --> 17:41.450
Forever...

17:45.450 --> 17:47.500
Sumomo!

17:53.860 --> 17:55.850
Sumomo, you can do it!

17:57.250 --> 18:00.150
You're right, Yuki-chan.

18:00.480 --> 18:02.410
I have to do my best.

18:04.140 --> 18:06.630
I have to help Nona-chan.

18:06.630 --> 18:09.740
That's right! If I use that chant...

18:11.440 --> 18:13.960
Timu Forna Mei!

18:18.190 --> 18:19.440
Sumomo!

18:19.700 --> 18:21.000
Sumomo!

18:21.600 --> 18:23.020
Yuki-chan?

18:25.510 --> 18:26.790
Are you alright?

18:27.340 --> 18:28.800
Haru-kun.

18:28.940 --> 18:31.480
Sumomo, slow down time.

18:31.580 --> 18:33.300
It's the same chant as last time.

18:33.350 --> 18:35.430
You should be able to slow down the wind.

18:35.530 --> 18:37.280
Why do you know that, Haru-kun?

18:37.580 --> 18:38.430
Quickly!

18:38.830 --> 18:43.400
I tried to, but I can't...

18:44.320 --> 18:47.640
You can do it. You can do it, Sumomo.

18:48.030 --> 18:49.250
You definitely can do it.

18:49.870 --> 18:50.990
Just be calm.

18:53.760 --> 18:55.960
Do your best, Sumomo.

19:01.080 --> 19:03.370
Timu Forna Mei!

19:13.210 --> 19:14.760
I did it.

19:15.310 --> 19:16.760
Sumomo, there!

19:17.310 --> 19:18.410
Nona-chan!

19:27.860 --> 19:30.450
The wind was caused by this Ladle?

19:32.230 --> 19:33.480
Sumomo!

19:33.480 --> 19:35.330
The Ladle is hot.

19:35.620 --> 19:37.260
What should I do?

19:37.760 --> 19:39.340
Let's try again.

19:40.050 --> 19:41.550
Nako-chan.

19:42.220 --> 19:43.680
Why...?

19:43.930 --> 19:47.620
I wanted to do something for you too, Sumomo.

19:47.880 --> 19:52.160
Not just watching you but something like what Tsuwabuki does.

20:32.780 --> 20:36.100
Miss! Miss get a hold of yourself!

20:36.120 --> 20:37.320
Miss!

20:42.940 --> 20:46.290
I'm so glad you're okay!

20:46.290 --> 20:47.560
Matsuda.

20:48.180 --> 20:50.000
What happened to me?

20:51.630 --> 20:55.090
This thing went berserk and caused that big whirlwind.

20:55.320 --> 20:59.210
Sumomo went into it and saved you.

21:05.320 --> 21:07.040
W-Why?

21:07.810 --> 21:09.780
Because Sumomo is a kind girl.

21:15.830 --> 21:20.340
So Haru-kun is... Haru-kun is Yuki-chan, right?

21:21.090 --> 21:25.100
I'm sorry for lying until now.

21:25.690 --> 21:31.920
No. I'm always being helped by Yuki-chan.

21:32.190 --> 21:36.480
And seeing Haru-kun's face at school makes me feel better.

21:36.650 --> 21:40.840
Haru-kun, thanks for everything...

21:42.190 --> 21:43.570
Haru-kun?

21:47.670 --> 21:53.580
Sorry, Su-mo-mo...

22:02.520 --> 22:04.910
Yuki-chan?

22:08.720 --> 22:11.810
What's wrong? Hey.

22:12.080 --> 22:13.690
Haru-kun?

22:17.080 --> 22:19.580
T-Tsuwabuki...

22:22.950 --> 22:24.360
Haru-kun?

22:27.320 --> 22:30.740
Hey! Come on, please say something!

22:31.280 --> 22:32.450
Haru-kun!

22:51.540 --> 22:55.090
kira kira no hoshikuzu ha maru de

22:51.540 --> 22:55.090
Fragments of glittering stars

22:55.090 --> 22:58.380
koi suru otome no kiseki

22:55.090 --> 22:58.380
are just like the miracles of a girl in love

22:58.630 --> 23:02.180
kinou mada no watashi ha doko he

22:58.630 --> 23:02.180
Where did the cleverness from yesterday go,

23:02.180 --> 23:05.100
nanika chigau RABIRINSU

23:02.180 --> 23:05.100
Since it's like a labyrinth now

23:05.600 --> 23:09.350
dan dan wakan naku naru

23:05.600 --> 23:09.350
Slowly becoming confused

23:09.520 --> 23:12.360
（doushi you　doushi you）

23:09.520 --> 23:12.360
What do I do? What do I do?

23:12.610 --> 23:19.570
don don afurete kuru　AH　HAHAHA

23:12.610 --> 23:19.570
Slowly becoming overflowed

23:19.740 --> 23:25.450
yume no naka jya　nandemo ieru no ni…

23:19.740 --> 23:25.450
But inside a dream, can't you say anything?

23:25.450 --> 23:29.080
yuuki kudasai

23:25.450 --> 23:29.080
Please give me courage

